      "start_line": 16,
      "text": "  rule decimalDigitSum(N:Int)\n    => decimalDigit(N, 1)\n       +Int decimalDigit(N, 10)\n       +Int decimalDigit(N, 100)\n       +Int decimalDigit(N, 1000)\n       +Int decimalDigit(N, 10000)\n    requires 0 <=Int N andBool N <=Int 10000"
